This project uses SDXL-Turbo sparse autoencoders trained and released by Surkov et al. / EPFL through the sdxl-unbox project. The public label dataset produced by latent-dance labels and analyzes those upstream SAE features; it does not claim authorship of the SAE training or checkpoint creation.

Major upstream components and artifacts include:

- SDXL-Turbo by Stability AI: https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/sdxl-turbo
- SDXL-Turbo SAE / sdxl-unbox by Surkov et al. / EPFL: https://github.com/surkovv/sdxl-unbox and https://sdxl-unbox.epfl.ch/
- Demucs by Meta/Facebook Research: https://github.com/facebookresearch/demucs
- Diffusers by Hugging Face: https://github.com/huggingface/diffusers
- Public latent-dance SAE labels dataset: https://huggingface.co/datasets/hammamiomar/sdxl-turbo-sae-labels

